From 486cfbcba018bb35c0a67efb7c6ee2d10c9feb67 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Adam Szewczyk <a.szewczyk@cthings.co>
Date: Fri, 3 Jul 2026 13:45:54 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] boot: zephyr: add ctcc/nrf9151 board configuration

MCUboot shipped serial-recovery board configs for ctcc/nrf52840 and
ctcc/nrf9161 but not for the ctcc/nrf9151 target that the ctcc
Connectivity Card board now provides.

- Add boot/zephyr/boards/ctcc_nrf9151.conf, mirroring the nRF9161 card:
  UART-based serial recovery (the card exposes a UART over its on-board
  USB-UART converter), no application boot, 5 s DFU wait, SPI NOR off.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-4-8
Signed-off-by: Adam Szewczyk <a.szewczyk@cthings.co>
---
 boot/zephyr/boards/ctcc_nrf9151.conf | 15 +++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 15 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 boot/zephyr/boards/ctcc_nrf9151.conf

diff --git a/boot/zephyr/boards/ctcc_nrf9151.conf b/boot/zephyr/boards/ctcc_nrf9151.conf
new file mode 100644
index 00000000..da32ec9f
--- /dev/null
+++ b/boot/zephyr/boards/ctcc_nrf9151.conf
@@ -0,0 +1,15 @@
+# Disable logging
+CONFIG_LOG=n
+CONFIG_CONSOLE=n
+CONFIG_UART_CONSOLE=n
+
+# MCUboot serial configuration
+CONFIG_MCUBOOT_SERIAL=y
+CONFIG_BOOT_SERIAL_UART=y
+CONFIG_BOOT_SERIAL_ENTRANCE_GPIO=n
+CONFIG_BOOT_SERIAL_WAIT_FOR_DFU=y
+CONFIG_BOOT_SERIAL_NO_APPLICATION=y
+CONFIG_BOOT_SERIAL_WAIT_FOR_DFU_TIMEOUT=5000
+
+# SPI NOR
+CONFIG_SPI_NOR=n
-- 
2.43.0

